 nSource URL: https://fmts-workshop.github.io/\nLocation: Sydney\, Austral
 ia\nTopics: Time Series & Sequential Data\, Machine Learning\, Deep Repre
 sentation Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\nSize: S\nSu
 bmission type: Workshop / non-archival short paper\nConfidence: estimated
 \nLast checked date: 2026-10-05\nNotes: Confirmed one-day NeurIPS 2026 wo
 rkshop. NeurIPS will assign either Dec 11 or Dec 12\; Dec 11 is a calenda
 r placeholder\, not a confirmed workshop day. The Nov 6 camera-ready date
  is tentative and is not listed as a deadline.\nScope: Foundation models 
 for temporal systems\, centered on long-horizon and probabilistic forecas
